{"3777300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "School Crisis", "steam_appid": 3777300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trespass into an elite all-girls campus. Sneak, complete missions, and don't get caught.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/db443fa2b55670d0c35334ff57298a56.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/db443fa2b55670d0c35334ff57298a56.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/db443fa2b55670d0c35334ff57298a56.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>School Crisis</strong>, a chaotic anime-inspired co-op game where <strong>up to 4 players team up as trespassers</strong> while <strong>1 player hunts them down as the principal</strong>. <strong>This is a multiplayer-only game</strong> — built to play with friends, so bring your crew or find a lobby in our Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are sneaking onto campus, each with your own questionable motivation. Maybe you're here for the thrill, or maybe you're just here to prove a point. Either way, your goal is simple: <br><br><strong>complete your missions, avoid the principal, and escape with your dignity intact.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/05a1fc119c105ab002796f0e3887bb39.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/05a1fc119c105ab002796f0e3887bb39.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/05a1fc119c105ab002796f0e3887bb39.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 PLAYABLE TRESPASSERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each guy has his own personality and animations. They can only talk to one specific girl on campus — pick the wrong one and she'll scream or attack. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a4bd326cee4612ad96096697f6bb9aad.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a4bd326cee4612ad96096697f6bb9aad.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a4bd326cee4612ad96096697f6bb9aad.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 PLAYABLE HUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the principal. Fast, relentless, and armed with whatever she can swing. Stealth helps. Teamwork helps more. But nothing saves you if she catches you slipping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/42dedcae6c2477d95a51d5402a705387.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/42dedcae6c2477d95a51d5402a705387.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/42dedcae6c2477d95a51d5402a705387.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBJECTIVE-BASED MISSIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the girls, collect what they need, and bring it back... preferably without the principal noticing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/3c4d4342e429721911368d517aa4fe54.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/3c4d4342e429721911368d517aa4fe54.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/3c4d4342e429721911368d517aa4fe54.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE YOUR FRIENDS... OR DON'T</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a teammate gets captured, you can break them out — or run for the exit while they scream your name. No judgment. (Okay, maybe a little.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/aa6a5cb20bfb73d8b22200085b134a35.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/aa6a5cb20bfb73d8b22200085b134a35.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/aa6a5cb20bfb73d8b22200085b134a35.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE MAPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite campus, beach, and hot spring. Same chaos, new places to get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/375fb4d76d6781b19f072495526e8d51.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/375fb4d76d6781b19f072495526e8d51.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/375fb4d76d6781b19f072495526e8d51.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCKABLE SKINS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and equip character skins. Look good while getting chased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/c7b78766c39deb6b15eea192947e7a2f.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/c7b78766c39deb6b15eea192947e7a2f.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/c7b78766c39deb6b15eea192947e7a2f.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMEDY MEETS CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ridiculous blend of panic and anime absurdity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/8c78f00f0f0f3e7a48d44bec9914342e.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/8c78f00f0f0f3e7a48d44bec9914342e.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/8c78f00f0f0f3e7a48d44bec9914342e.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>School Crisis</strong> isn't just a game. It's a test of stealth, teamwork, friendship, and who's got the guts to <strong>sneak </strong>their way through danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to cause chaos on the most prestigious campus you'll ever sneak into?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/9ffe277e11cf2af4d12b315d374e3c7c.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/9ffe277e11cf2af4d12b315d374e3c7c.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/9ffe277e11cf2af4d12b315d374e3c7c.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Phumi — the solo developer behind School Crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game ever. I started working on it over three and a half years ago with a lot of passion, and probably too much coffee. Every character, every map, every ridiculous moment — built by one person learning as I went.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you decide to pick it up, thank you. Seriously. It means more than you know.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trespass into an elite all-girls campus. Sneak, complete missions, and don't get caught.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/db443fa2b55670d0c35334ff57298a56.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/db443fa2b55670d0c35334ff57298a56.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/db443fa2b55670d0c35334ff57298a56.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>School Crisis</strong>, a chaotic anime-inspired co-op game where <strong>up to 4 players team up as trespassers</strong> while <strong>1 player hunts them down as the principal</strong>. <strong>This is a multiplayer-only game</strong> — built to play with friends, so bring your crew or find a lobby in our Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are sneaking onto campus, each with your own questionable motivation. Maybe you're here for the thrill, or maybe you're just here to prove a point. Either way, your goal is simple: <br><br><strong>complete your missions, avoid the principal, and escape with your dignity intact.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/05a1fc119c105ab002796f0e3887bb39.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/05a1fc119c105ab002796f0e3887bb39.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/05a1fc119c105ab002796f0e3887bb39.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 PLAYABLE TRESPASSERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each guy has his own personality and animations. They can only talk to one specific girl on campus — pick the wrong one and she'll scream or attack. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a4bd326cee4612ad96096697f6bb9aad.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a4bd326cee4612ad96096697f6bb9aad.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a4bd326cee4612ad96096697f6bb9aad.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 PLAYABLE HUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the principal. Fast, relentless, and armed with whatever she can swing. Stealth helps. Teamwork helps more. But nothing saves you if she catches you slipping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/42dedcae6c2477d95a51d5402a705387.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/42dedcae6c2477d95a51d5402a705387.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/42dedcae6c2477d95a51d5402a705387.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBJECTIVE-BASED MISSIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the girls, collect what they need, and bring it back... preferably without the principal noticing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/3c4d4342e429721911368d517aa4fe54.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/3c4d4342e429721911368d517aa4fe54.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/3c4d4342e429721911368d517aa4fe54.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE YOUR FRIENDS... OR DON'T</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a teammate gets captured, you can break them out — or run for the exit while they scream your name. No judgment. (Okay, maybe a little.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/aa6a5cb20bfb73d8b22200085b134a35.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/aa6a5cb20bfb73d8b22200085b134a35.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/aa6a5cb20bfb73d8b22200085b134a35.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE MAPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite campus, beach, and hot spring. Same chaos, new places to get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/375fb4d76d6781b19f072495526e8d51.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/375fb4d76d6781b19f072495526e8d51.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/375fb4d76d6781b19f072495526e8d51.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCKABLE SKINS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and equip character skins. Look good while getting chased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/c7b78766c39deb6b15eea192947e7a2f.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/c7b78766c39deb6b15eea192947e7a2f.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/c7b78766c39deb6b15eea192947e7a2f.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMEDY MEETS CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ridiculous blend of panic and anime absurdity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/8c78f00f0f0f3e7a48d44bec9914342e.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/8c78f00f0f0f3e7a48d44bec9914342e.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/8c78f00f0f0f3e7a48d44bec9914342e.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>School Crisis</strong> isn't just a game. It's a test of stealth, teamwork, friendship, and who's got the guts to <strong>sneak </strong>their way through danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to cause chaos on the most prestigious campus you'll ever sneak into?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/9ffe277e11cf2af4d12b315d374e3c7c.poster.avif?t=1787326612\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/9ffe277e11cf2af4d12b315d374e3c7c.webm?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/9ffe277e11cf2af4d12b315d374e3c7c.mp4?t=1787326612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Phumi — the solo developer behind School Crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game ever. I started working on it over three and a half years ago with a lot of passion, and probably too much coffee. Every character, every map, every ridiculous moment — built by one person learning as I went.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you decide to pick it up, thank you. Seriously. It means more than you know.</p>", "short_description": "Sneak into an all-girls campus. Talk to girls, complete missions, and don't get caught by the principal. Asymmetrical anime chaos for up to 5 players.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/77ef7304848e178404564ebad85690767900c7c7/header.jpg?t=1787326612", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/696e12dc432b0cafb85033e68273f056f8dab951/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787326612", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/696e12dc432b0cafb85033e68273f056f8dab951/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787326612", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64‑bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5–7400 @ ~3.0 GHz (or AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 (or AMD equivalent) with Shader Model 5, DirectX 11<br></li><li><strong>Netw